![](https://storage.googleapis.com/gweb-workspace-assets/uploads/7uffzv9dk4sn-7LhoZoRSU32Sn20yI8213k-92d83d07ba564bddac887d329c3589c2-Vector.svg)Premium feature

To get [Gemini for Google Workspace](https://workspace.google.com/solutions/ai/), you need an existing Workspace plan.

## Add events from email with a click

When Gemini detects event details in an email, simply click the "Add to Calendar" button to save it to Calendar. Your event details are accurately captured, right from Gmail.

 ![An email with Gemini’s “Add to Calendar” suggestion.](https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/3cZXhtFEVwBbgBwwS9gZYzWB-u-W1gTqD_r2v4FaKM6JOGq02JNQ2gebc3LiF1OukuL1pdJk1esJ_JbjOnrAq5vkZp7G2maRor0=e365-pa-nu-rw-w608)

